      "id": 8037178015926,
      "title": "The Stakt Mat Pro",
      "handle": "the-stakt-mat-pro",
      "body_html": "<p>Everything you love about the Stakt Mat, plus a premium textured layer for enhanced performance.</p>\n<p><strong>What makes the Stakt Mat Pro different?</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"> <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Premium Durability:</strong><span> The premium textured layer provides added strength, ensuring your mat stands up to even the most rigorous workouts.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Grip: </strong>Perfect for high-impact exercises, sneaker-clad routines, and those intense sweaty yoga sessions, the Stakt Mat Pro offers unmatched stability and support.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>12 mm thick, 69\" L x 24 W\" Flat, 12\" L x 3\" H x 24\" W Folded</span></p>\n<p><span></span><span><br><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Patent #US-D1050762-S<br><br></span></p>\n<!---->",
